Crystal city
The second city of the game, crystal city contains all the major maps for the story mode, as well as different challenges and stores. It also acts as a connection to the land of the sealed, and possesses a demon realm as well.
Accessed through the train station in evermore city. Also can be used to travel back to evermore city.
The maps here are important in nature. The list is as follows.
Fishing spot. You can go here to catch fishes, then sell them in the sellers corner.
The frozen forest, a map which is a tricky challenge. Inside there is a door with password, as well as several signs scattered across. Your job is to read all the signs. One of them is the correct password to the door. When you get across the door you will be asked to press shift enter, do it and you will be moved in to a volcano. The volcano is your main challenge. Cross it by jumping your way forward. Reward, one volcano pack.
The sellers corner, can be used to sell the different items in your inventory.
The road of nightmares, a challenge map. You have to jump ahead while avoiding the fire tiles on the map. Reward, 1000 aura.
Crystal mall, a place where you can by various items from the different stores located inside.
The library, the first quest of the story mode. More information is provided in the story mode section.
The unseelers base, the second quest of the story mode. More information can be found in the story mode section.
The riddlers maze. Another challenge. When you get inside you'll find that you cannot find the way through the track menu. You have to walk around and locate your way. Then you will encounter various different paths. Only a single one is correct. If you choose the right one you will pass the challenge, if chosen wrong? Well, you die. Boomboom. So be careful! Reward, one riddlers pack.
The train station. Takes you back to evermore city.
The abandoned factory. Third quest in the story mode. More information in the story mode section.
The magical forest. The fourth and penultimate quest of the story mode. More information in the story mode section.
The tower. Fifth and last quest of the story mode.
The land of the sealed. A place containing several maps, having mythical creatures. More information can be found in the section for the land of the sealed.
Inferno challenge, another one of the many challenges of the game.
Demon realm. A haunted place containing five levels. If you can go through all the levels you will get a kings statue as a reward, which can be used to unleash a demon king which can attack your enemies. The entrance of the map can be found below the ladder that leads down, in crystal city. The map only opens at nighttime.